<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-farhadifar-drosophila-wing-vertex-model-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Farhadifar et al. (2007) Drosophila wing disc apical vertex model & Lewis's law epithelial packing — Model fidelity to source: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Faithfully implements the Farhadifar et al. (2007) Eq. (1)-(2) apical vertex energy functional (`compute_single_cell_vertex_energy`, L98-126), analytical ground-state phase classification across Case I, Case II, and Case III (`classify_farhadifar_ground_state`, L129-178), UV laser adherens-junction ablation recoil kinetics (`simulate_laser_ablation_recoil`, L181-209), Lewis's Law (1928) linear area-side scaling (`lewis_law_ratio`, L212-218), and 2D periodic vertex packing across proliferating larval, annealed pupal, high-contractility, and soft Case II regimes (`simulate_vertex_regime`, L258-404). Backed by 4 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
